<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9070" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνῐσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Aesar.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Stob.
			1.49.27
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unequal, uneven,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				36d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἄ.</span>”
				<i>inequality,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1129b1
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πολιτεία,</span> of an
			oligarchy, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.30
			</span></i>: so of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1280a13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. κατά τι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>; but also, <i>not content with equality</i> or
				<i>justice, unjust,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1129a33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1129b10
			</span></i>; <i>unfair,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.263
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>). Adv.
			<i>unequally,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				61
			</span></i>; <i>unfairly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. σχεῖν πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.168
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. νενεμῆσθαι τὰς ἀρχάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1282b24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
